  "content": "\n\n# <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lalaalal/Naraka/26.2/common/src/main/resources/assets/naraka/textures/item/stigma_rod.png\" width=\"24\"> Naraka : Rise of Herobrine\n\n欢迎来到 Naraka！本模组添加了 Herobrine 首领、新矿石，以及由原版矿石打造的强力材料。击败首领以获取奖励，并使用新材料打造强力武器！\n\n## 特性\n- **Herobrine**：潜伏在 Herobrine 圣殿中的恐怖首领。\n- **钻石傀儡**：守护钻石柱的强大实体。\n- **蜜源矿（Nectarium）**：一种独特的可食用矿石，味道出乎意料地美味！\n\n> ### ![圣殿指南针](https://github.com/lalaalal/Naraka/blob/26.2/common/src/main/resources/assets/naraka/textures/item/sanctuary_compass_00.png?raw=true) 前往 Herobrine 之路\n> 向流浪商人购买或在大村庄制图师的箱子里寻找**圣殿指南针**。\n\n<details>\n<summary>图片</summary>\n  <img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/3724937cfb82b6ef598c69ff44102f81f8b180ba3db6a539ac36d19a1f936614/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e6d6f6472696e74682e636f6d2f646174612f32496e53355377692f696d616765732f623433383032326262333332346537613638636137616433396230653863393565303038353630632e706e67\" width=\"256\">\n  <img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/f4e19acaf8da64bdf69c5c1b00e9c03f0750775ede73e5d51829b954cfea5275/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e6d6f6472696e74682e636f6d2f646174612f32496e53355377692f696d616765732f353931366234616535613462613161343438376530353438353766343430623739373862326533352e706e67\" width=\"256\">\n  <img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9d1ef423d0a1d2f8681a4bed87fecaefbf616b1b1ee2c314225d5c8b650d5510/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e6d6f6472696e74682e636f6d2f646174612f32496e53355377692f696d616765732f656131353662346164346665323562356236383534393439343033633065626233616361613439322e676966\" width=\"256\">\n</details>\n\n## 依赖\n- fabric-api（仅限 Fabric 加载器）\n \n## 鸣谢\n- Qiye_Duyu（中文翻译）\n- h2o/aoinnman（日文翻译）\n- htohtosgoy（替代资源包）\n- Player_7（代码贡献）\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ceRN9eZkXY0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>",
